WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.451
Three Priorities.

2
00:00:01.451 --> 00:00:03.355
Three tasks arrive at once:

3
00:00:03.355 --> 00:00:05.016
one is urgent, one affects

4
00:00:05.016 --> 00:00:06.896
a customer, and one has a later

5
00:00:06.896 --> 00:00:08.800
deadline but takes the longest.

6
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.043
What do you do?

7
00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:10.391
A...

8
00:00:10.391 --> 00:00:11.320
Do them in the order

9
00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.179
they arrived.

10
00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:12.795
B...

11
00:00:12.795 --> 00:00:14.350
Start the longest task first

12
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.488
so it is out of the way.

13
00:00:15.999 --> 00:00:16.707
C...

14
00:00:16.707 --> 00:00:18.623
Assess urgency, impact,

15
00:00:18.623 --> 00:00:20.213
deadlines, and dependencies

16
00:00:20.213 --> 00:00:21.758
before sequencing the work.

17
00:00:22.361 --> 00:00:23.093
D...

18
00:00:23.093 --> 00:00:24.219
Ask someone else which

19
00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:25.020
task you should do

20
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.796
every time priorities compete.
